cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the DraCor Textbook, please cite it as below."
title: "DraCor Textbook"
abstract: >-
  The DraCor Textbook is a curated, pedagogically structured Open Educational
  Resource (OER) for working with the programmable drama corpora of DraCor.
  This book covers corpus building, TEI encoding, the DraCor front-end, the
  DraCor API and the DraCor infrastructure.
